{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16215110","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16215110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1621511001:1":{"text":"「영유아 마법 입문」이라는 그 마법책, 찾아왔어?","source_cn":"魔法书呢？那本叫《婴幼儿魔法启蒙》的，你们弄回来了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3631904E3141A43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621511002:1":{"text":"윽, 그...그게... 냥리스한테서 훔치긴 했는데 오, 오는 길에 인간 학생들한테 들켜서...","source_cn":"呃，从、从从……喵丽丝那边确实偷到了，但、但回来的路上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D6442EF765D4519","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621511003:1":{"text":"들킬까 봐 어쩔 수 없이 책을 버렸어... 도서관으로 가져간 것 같아.","source_cn":"我们怕暴露，只能丢下书……他们好像把它带回了图书馆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7908CB4872A3DCAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621511004:1":{"text":"뭐?! 그건 엄청나게 사악한 마법책이야!","source_cn":"什么！？那可是一本极其邪恶的魔法书！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F4EDD6726BB66F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621511005:1":{"text":"마왕 냥리스의 손에 들어가면 라이세움 전체가 고양이 스크래처가 되고 말 거야!","source_cn":"如果落到喵丽丝那个魔王的手里，整个莱希拉姆都得变成猫抓板！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE18A778D7A5F2DF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621511006:1":{"text":"이제... 어떡하지?","source_cn":"现在……怎么办呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF33743378D2E6E04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1621511007:1":{"text":"냥리스가 분명 책이 사라진 걸 눈치챘을 거야. 지금쯤 바짝 경계하고 있겠지.","source_cn":"喵丽丝肯定已经察觉书丢了，现在一定提高警惕了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8DE2EB22D92ABF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1621511008:1":{"text":"책을 없앨 수 없다면, 그 못된 고양이가 성공하기 전에 정면으로 치는 수밖에 없어.","source_cn":"既然我们没法销毁那本书，就只能赶在她得逞之前，正面对决...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53944DDBF49B844A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1621511009:1":{"text":"뭐, 뭐?! 멍멍달 너.. 미쳤어? 냥리스를 치겠다고?","source_cn":"什、什么！？你疯……疯了吧汪达尔！你要跟喵丽丝硬碰硬？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1DFC6618B1873A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1621511010:1":{"text":"걘 수염 하나만으로도 참새 떼를 털 공으로 만들어서 던져버릴 수 있대! ","source_cn":"听说她只用一根猫胡须就能施法，把整群麻雀卷成个毛球飞走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D90C187CA97DF40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1621511011:1":{"text":"아무도 냥리스가 싸우는 모습을 본 적 없지만, 다들 바람 마법이 엄청 무섭다던데... 너 죽, 죽을지도 몰라!","source_cn":"谁也没真见过她出手，但大家都说她的风魔法超可怕……你、...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AA1A33768B4E471","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1621511012:1":{"text":"너 혼자 가. 난 고양이의 노예가 되기 싫어!","source_cn":"你一个人去吧！我可不想变成猫奴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD25ABBB34DBEDA5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1621511013:1":{"text":"아, 저기... 그, 그게.. 나 아직 밥을 덜 먹어서... 먼저 갈게.","source_cn":"阿就、就……我还有饭没吃完，我先走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFF288DF8B1B37CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1621511014:1":{"text":"개들이 우루르 흩어져 순식간에 자취를 감췄다. 남은 것은 굳은 눈빛으로 꼬리를 높이 치켜든 멍멍달 뿐이었다.","source_cn":"几只狗狗一哄而散，转眼就跑得不见踪影。只剩下汪达尔站在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D1F85EDA0EB12A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1621511015:1":{"text":"...실리, 피피! 너희도 쫄았냐고!","source_cn":"……憨憨，屁屁！连你们也怕了吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCF7A3A2C7806C08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1621511016:1":{"text":"나 혼자 남더라도... 절대 물러서지 않겠어!","source_cn":"就算只剩下我一只狗……我也绝不会退缩！<key:dia...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x059EAF53CCDA468B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:汪达尔":{"text":"멍멍달","source":"汪达尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:口吃的狗狗":{"text":"말 더듬는 강아지","source":"口吃的狗狗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:憨憨的狗狗":{"text":"어리숙한 강아지","source":"憨憨的狗狗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":4}}